{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07435","headline":"青溪口送人归岳州 · 刘长卿","name":"青溪口送人归岳州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭何处鴈南飞，江菼苍苍客去稀。\n帆带夕阳千里没，天连秋水一人归。\n黄花裛露开沙岸，白鸟衔鱼上钓矶。\n岐路相逢无可赠，老年空有泪沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}